->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">When a Deal Dies at the 50-Yard Line</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Hi </span>Sara,</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">I\u2019m in the middle of my busiest season ever, and this week, three deals died.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">All three had cleared diligence. Purchase agreements were drafted. We were basically at the 50-yard line\u2026and then, poof.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">If you\u2019ve ever made it that far and still watched a deal fall apart, you know how brutal it is.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\"><strong>Here\u2019s what kills deals that are THIS close to closing:</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">1. A surprise pops up<strong><br><br></strong>Think lawsuit, data breach, or a key employee walking out.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">It might not even be a big deal, just bad timing. When something hits late, there\u2019s no time to get clarity. Buyers bail. Solid reps and warranties can save you here by forcing disclosure upfront.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">2. Overlawyering<strong><br><br></strong>A $300K asset purchase does not need a 90-page agreement.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">If your legal team has no business sense, the deal can stall out fast. Sellers walk. Buyers burn out. And you\u2019re left with redlines and regrets.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">A good lawyer should help you close, not just edit.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">3. Last-minute deal breaker<strong><br><br></strong>Even with a solid LOI, big terms sometimes surface late, like indemnity or personal guarantees.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">If the gap\u2019s too big and no one will move, the deal\u2019s done. Painful, but better now than post-close.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Want more real talk about how deals get done\u2014or don\u2019t?<br><br>I share weekly insights from the front lines. And if you missed this week\u2019s video, </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/cff852204c9?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\" title=\"\"><span style=\"color: #3425db !important; color: #3425db !important; color: #3425db !important; font-size: 14px\">it\u2019s live now on YouTube.</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">To fewer landmines,<br>Sara Sharp<br>Deal Attorney &amp; Founder of Deal Academy</span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><p>For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/ca53d775a88?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Dealmakers Youtube Channel </span></a>where you'll find Sara's <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/211d3e5bbc7?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;v=csIoWCXhXsE&amp;t=15s\" title=\"Weekly Wine Down\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Weekly Wine Down,</span></a> where she talks about what she's seen in the industry this week and interviews with M&amp;A Experts and Dealmakers.</p><p>You can check out some recent Dealmakers YouTube videos by clicking the images below.</p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"full\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"min-width:100%;max-width:100%;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;\">\n        <tbody>\n     